      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628024,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "可靠，指的是数据能够正常收到，且能够顺序收到，于是就有了ARQ协议，\nTCP之所以可靠就是基于此。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 47,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "可靠，指的是数据能够正常收到，且能够顺序收到，于是就有了ARQ协议，\nTCP之所以可靠就是基于此。"
    },
    {
      "id": "zpbIvqwtUZkosF0_WpM0r",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 38.43393918939756,
      "y": 1445.9222123887794,
      "width": 513,
