      "updated": 1700315628024,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2.3 ARQ协议(Automatic Repeat-reQuest)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 30,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2.3 ARQ协议(Automatic Repeat-reQuest)"
    },
    {
      "id": "aBfANS3GOkHbS0VOSWhaQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 63.23395749994444,
      "y": 1500.2222154405372,
      "width": 794,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1061308445,
      "version": 146,
      "versionNonce": 22425981,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628024,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ARQ协议(Automatic Repeat-reQuest)，即自动重传请求，是传输层的错误纠正协议之一。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ARQ协议(Automatic Repeat-reQuest)，即自动重传请求，是传输层的错误纠正协议之一。"
    },
    {
      "id": "vMpCVbgp-aB6q42qVegV3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 72.03397581049131,
      "y": 1593.0221879747169,
      "width": 235,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 50041907,
      "version": 160,
      "versionNonce": 192770259,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628024,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ARQ协议主要有3种模式：",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ARQ协议主要有3种模式："
    },
    {
      "id": "9xBO5rWV0tXL3E3c2SMxK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 72.03397581049131,
      "y": 1629.0221879747169,
      "width": 309,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1801272445,
      "version": 163,
      "versionNonce": 166525405,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628024,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "（1）即停等式(stop-and-wait)ARQ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "（1）即停等式(stop-and-wait)ARQ"
    },
    {
      "id": "SU7DDI8HZmdCMub-d8IzY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 72.03397581049131,
      "y": 1665.0221879747169,
      "width": 289,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1904252371,
      "version": 163,
      "versionNonce": 316530291,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "（2）回退n帧(go-back-n)ARQ，",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "（2）回退n帧(go-back-n)ARQ，"
    },
    {
      "id": "JWrsjFavhOY5Mk0OFz__t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 72.03397581049131,
      "y": 1701.0221879747169,
      "width": 349,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1423615197,
      "version": 163,
      "versionNonce": 2035004989,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "（3）选择性重传(selective repeat)ARQ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "（3）选择性重传(selective repeat)ARQ"
    },
    {
      "id": "Rd9PChufzWuhelLXWjSOp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 55.03397581049131,
      "y": 1539.2222154405372,
      "width": 661,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d9480f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1050574483,
      "version": 177,
      "versionNonce": 1528797203,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "它通过使用确认和超时两个机制，在不可靠的网络上实现可靠的信息传输。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "它通过使用确认和超时两个机制，在不可靠的网络上实现可靠的信息传输。"
    },
    {
      "id": "tw91imQL-i3_vRDzIbOCn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 38.63392087885069,
      "y": 1767.7222306993262,
      "width": 466,
      "height": 37,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d9480f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 384585299,
      "version": 173,
      "versionNonce": 441706141,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2.3.1 ARQ协议-停等式(stop-and-wait)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 30,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2.3.1 ARQ协议-停等式(stop-and-wait)"
    },
    {
      "id": "UbqxvYSDFZziDPb7VRQMm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 87.63398191400694,
      "y": 1824.7222306993262,
      "width": 241,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1659079741,
      "version": 138,
      "versionNonce": 1379474867,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "停等协议的工作原理如下：",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "停等协议的工作原理如下："
    },
    {
      "id": "6CrWJG6_H9xZstKloe7Sw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 87.63398191400694,
      "y": 1871.7222306993262,
      "width": 653,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1477976595,
      "version": 138,
      "versionNonce": 1605831421,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1、发送方对接收方发送数据包，然后等待接收方回复ACK并且开始计时。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1、发送方对接收方发送数据包，然后等待接收方回复ACK并且开始计时。"
    },
    {
      "id": "SxdhPMDU3tyfJ06n4V7AY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 87.63398191400694,
      "y": 1918.7222306993262,
      "width": 432,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1853947037,
      "version": 138,
      "versionNonce": 1666248531,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2、在等待过程中，发送方停止发送新的数据包。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2、在等待过程中，发送方停止发送新的数据包。"
    },
    {
      "id": "4SAC82CKnPHClRmau4AVE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 87.63398191400694,
      "y": 1965.7222306993262,
      "width": 959,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1938843571,
      "version": 138,
      "versionNonce": 1777771357,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3、当数据包没有成功被接收方接收，接收方不会发送ACK.这样发送方在等待一定时间后，重新发送数据包。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3、当数据包没有成功被接收方接收，接收方不会发送ACK.这样发送方在等待一定时间后，重新发送数据包。"
    },
    {
      "id": "QGJg1RLWcLOkw6ll4UjSo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 87.63398191400694,
      "y": 2012.7222306993262,
      "width": 419,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 433152253,
      "version": 138,
      "versionNonce": 1354599667,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4、反复以上步骤直到收到从接收方发送的ACK.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4、反复以上步骤直到收到从接收方发送的ACK."
    },
    {
      "id": "xx6lJ2ABUtDOByaNp9BOK",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 163.29833706783353,
      "y": 2063.32226732042,
      "width": 533.2363449209153,
      "height": 347.79998779296875,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "transparent",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1345959101,
      "version": 162,
      "versionNonce": 1298411453,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "status": "saved",
      "fileId": "f89d91481bd01c9be9133dae511b5de240bdee41",
      "scale": [
        1,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HTSNENFWLbE9cfHbM4GXT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 175.43393918939756,
      "y": 2446.022218492295,
      "width": 421,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d9480f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 969426227,
      "version": 131,
      "versionNonce": 1308980883,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "缺点：较长的等待时间导致低的数据传输速度。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "缺点：较长的等待时间导致低的数据传输速度。"
    },
    {
      "id": "YZrWdu0zyYympLq8Ryg4d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40.43396970697569,
      "y": 2532.522249009873,
      "width": 438,
      "height": 37,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d9480f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 842537683,
      "version": 166,
      "versionNonce": 404828189,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2.3.2 ARQ协议-回退n帧(go-back-n)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 30,
