      "seed": 748151933,
      "version": 115,
      "versionNonce": 612051443,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2.4 流量控制",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 30,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2.4 流量控制"
    },
    {
      "id": "wbkReQ0rSMmc6j_or3YHh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 73.03397581049131,
      "y": 4165.922151353623,
      "width": 452,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1750518803,
      "version": 121,
      "versionNonce": 1402659517,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "（1）发送方的速率与接收方的速率是不一定相等。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "（1）发送方的速率与接收方的速率是不一定相等。"
    },
    {
      "id": "KPBcWSv6ZL6v_vQ3TnGua",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 73.03397581049131,
      "y": 4212.922151353623,
      "width": 1072,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 106558109,
      "version": 117,
      "versionNonce": 1913090963,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "（2）如果缓存区满了发送方还在疯狂着发送数据，接收方只能把收到的数据包丢掉，大量的丢包会极大着浪费网络资源。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "（2）如果缓存区满了发送方还在疯狂着发送数据，接收方只能把收到的数据包丢掉，大量的丢包会极大着浪费网络资源。"
    },
    {
      "id": "bKDo6qQ08ufJ312waYfSL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 73.03397581049131,
      "y": 4259.922151353623,
      "width": 452,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 443142579,
      "version": 117,
      "versionNonce": 722043677,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "（3）对发送方发送速率的控制，称之为流量控制。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "（3）对发送方发送速率的控制，称之为流量控制。"
    },
    {
      "id": "2ooxoRd9lyv14M_cUmCD6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 407.4340002245538,
      "y": 4335.4222429063575,
      "width": 81,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d9480f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 500906877,
      "version": 133,
      "versionNonce": 110725427,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "窗口机制",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "窗口机制"
    },
    {
      "id": "JDjLC4W585mH-K-I2Gfa8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 35.34506861105558,
      "y": 4502.633292304144,
      "width": 309,
      "height": 37,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d9480f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 927307251,
      "version": 159,
      "versionNonce": 395832019,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2.4 流量控制-如何控制？",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 30,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2.4 流量控制-如何控制？"
    },
    {
      "id": "_HiGYOFJNwgFE6k4Pk13D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 29.611727817869735,
      "y": 4581.611106024847,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 53,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1881753939,
      "version": 178,
      "versionNonce": 1045372893,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "接收方每次收到数据包，可以在发送确定报文的时候，同时告诉发送方自己的缓存区还剩余多少是空闲的。\n 把缓存区的剩余大小称之为接收窗口大小，用变量win来表示接收窗口的大小。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 47,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "接收方每次收到数据包，可以在发送确定报文的时候，同时告诉发送方自己的缓存区还剩余多少是空闲的。\n 把缓存区的剩余大小称之为接收窗口大小，用变量win来表示接收窗口的大小。"
    },
    {
      "id": "eZkXyiqQM-abb8ciQt5_a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 43.74510997932822,
      "y": 4669.766681247286,
      "width": 852,
      "height": 53,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2028530013,
      "version": 181,
      "versionNonce": 1771640947,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "发送方收到之后，便会调整自己的发送速率，也就是调整自己发送窗口的大小，\n当发送方收到接收窗口的大小为0时，发送方就会停止发送数据，防止出现大量丢包情况的发生。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 47,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "发送方收到之后，便会调整自己的发送速率，也就是调整自己发送窗口的大小，\n当发送方收到接收窗口的大小为0时，发送方就会停止发送数据，防止出现大量丢包情况的发生。"
    },
    {
      "id": "UVkSIS7470rY_h1xv3A2F",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 102.24580524652976,
      "y": 4749.722230699326,
      "width": 632.256413141012,
      "height": 454.2000122070313,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "transparent",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 179709267,
      "version": 184,
      "versionNonce": 1786321981,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "status": "saved",
      "fileId": "9d02c522ac74ab06385ee04eb11adc3a10a654c5",
      "scale": [
        1,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "oJ-gaO19HyQBjkuCXCrEt",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 620.7670337452716,
      "y": 4994.884451960243,
      "width": 565.3336888179398,
      "height": 460.4468083954749,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "transparent",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 987565309,
      "version": 326,
      "versionNonce": 1784910355,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "status": "saved",
      "fileId": "29d0dfc8399578729dd61dc03652d53b1d73934b",
      "scale": [
        1,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lGyLFBi1JPxzB5iMgc4TT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 73.23395749994444,
      "y": 5456.422212388779,
      "width": 738,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1864ab",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 215555027,
      "version": 193,
      "versionNonce": 216304797,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 当接收方处理好数据，接受窗口 win > 0 时，接收方发个通知报文去通知发送方。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 当接收方处理好数据，接受窗口 win > 0 时，接收方发个通知报文去通知发送方。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ANPb2z9oaFa1gb4FmgLer",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 73.23395749994444,
      "y": 5492.422212388779,
      "width": 817,
      "height": 53,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1864ab",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 498433757,
      "version": 197,
      "versionNonce": 183359411,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. 当发送方收到接受窗口 win = 0 时，这时发送方停止发送报文，并且同时开启一个定时器，\n每隔一段时间就发个测试报文去询问接收方，打听是否可以继续发送数据了。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 47,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. 当发送方收到接受窗口 win = 0 时，这时发送方停止发送报文，并且同时开启一个定时器，\n每隔一段时间就发个测试报文去询问接收方，打听是否可以继续发送数据了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "VcZs-M_wqFzswyQvf-Drf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 57.83396360346006,
      "y": 5403.422212388779,
      "width": 290.76923076923447,
      "height": 30.00000000000038,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1864ab",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2145551997,
      "version": 122,
      "versionNonce": 1162014973,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "发送方何时再继续发送数据?",
      "fontSize": 23.07692307692337,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 24.00000000000038,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "发送方何时再继续发送数据?"
    },
    {
      "id": "3Uv0zTz_OcYaTjRAtWvPG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 37.83393308588194,
      "y": 5670.522249009873,
      "width": 225,
      "height": 37,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d9480f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2142877309,
      "version": 150,
      "versionNonce": 1091946845,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2.4 流量控制-小结",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 30,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2.4 流量控制-小结"
    },
    {
      "id": "NA6ieXS-2iSrxuUP8buVX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 78.16725963753123,
      "y": 5729.122143215603,
      "width": 725,
      "height": 53,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 932178771,
      "version": 257,
      "versionNonce": 1527498483,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "（1）接收窗口的大小固定吗？\n        不是固定的，需要根据网络情况动态调整，丢包多的时候需要减小接收窗口。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 47,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "（1）接收窗口的大小固定吗？\n        不是固定的，需要根据网络情况动态调整，丢包多的时候需要减小接收窗口。"
    },
    {
      "id": "Wi5ZU5m8Ento9jW9TyVE_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76.47839651904167,
      "y": 5810.166559855142,
      "width": 285,
      "height": 53,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 976578397,
      "version": 206,
      "versionNonce": 28218813,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "（2）接收窗口越大越好吗？\n        接收窗口过大容易导致丢包",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 47,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "（2）接收窗口越大越好吗？\n        接收窗口过大容易导致丢包"
    },
    {
      "id": "pAk3pBUT4lVZ_DL4ODG3v",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 69.27843517464066,
      "y": 5888.89988708496,
      "width": 311,
      "height": 53,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1002244339,
      "version": 219,
      "versionNonce": 645689491,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "（3）发送窗口和接收窗口相等吗？\n         一般接收窗口 >= 发送窗口。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 47,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "（3）发送窗口和接收窗口相等吗？\n         一般接收窗口 >= 发送窗口。"
    },
    {
      "id": "YNHOuq_ZMbvtmt2xoK60l",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.63398191400694,
      "y": 6052.122224595811,
      "width": 152,
      "height": 37,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d9480f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1299409267,
      "version": 125,
      "versionNonce": 1647236637,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2.5拥塞控制",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 30,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2.5拥塞控制"
    },
    {
      "id": "Ww6H8kPI9ksWdZodUq5pU",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 52.7710893519631,
      "y": 6121.722230699326,
      "width": 860.1257485029939,
      "height": 379,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "transparent",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 585009885,
      "version": 88,
      "versionNonce": 1030153779,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "status": "saved",
      "fileId": "cb918464770da860fda90028550b741b879f89ec",
      "scale": [
        1,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "6F6m3R3rgss9Czk2B_dGD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 66.03397581049131,
      "y": 6538.9222429063575,
      "width": 1101,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 538750717,
      "version": 128,
      "versionNonce": 1569196669,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "拥塞控制和流量控制虽然采取的动作很相似，但拥塞控制与网络的拥堵情况相关联，而流量控制与接收方的缓存状态相关联。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "拥塞控制和流量控制虽然采取的动作很相似，但拥塞控制与网络的拥堵情况相关联，而流量控制与接收方的缓存状态相关联。"
    },
    {
      "id": "VZT_Buiop98yNMhaf9GiK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 123.43396970697569,
      "y": 6582.222261216904,
      "width": 561,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d9480f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 939425619,
      "version": 185,
      "versionNonce": 649177043,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "拥塞控制是根据丢包情况调整发送窗口，调整发送数据的速率。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "拥塞控制是根据丢包情况调整发送窗口，调整发送数据的速率。"
    },
    {
