      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "以10%-20%带宽浪费的代价换取了比 TCP快30%-40%的传输速度。"
    },
