      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4.2 kcp使用方式",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 30,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4.2 kcp使用方式"
    },
    {
      "id": "7pQVuwin9wdPDpKAqOT4C",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 81.43393918939756,
      "y": 9874.92221238878,
      "width": 506,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d9480f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2070616445,
      "version": 121,
      "versionNonce": 1168134771,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 创建 KCP对象：ikcpcb *kcp = ikcp_create(conv, user);",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 创建 KCP对象：ikcpcb *kcp = ikcp_create(conv, user);"
    },
    {
      "id": "OeqChGX35XxEDE5XAD63z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 81.43393918939756,
      "y": 9921.92221238878,
      "width": 642,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d9480f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 394987731,
      "version": 121,
      "versionNonce": 555385405,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. 设置发送回调函数（如UDP的send函数）：kcp->output = udp_output;",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. 设置发送回调函数（如UDP的send函数）：kcp->output = udp_output;"
    },
    {
      "id": "5z96pCEPMLF94edxTq2OR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 81.43393918939756,
      "y": 9968.92221238878,
      "width": 283,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d9480f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1092936157,
      "version": 127,
      "versionNonce": 1970506771,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "    真正发送数据需要调用sendto",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "    真正发送数据需要调用sendto"
    },
    {
      "id": "fFSpE5SLmgINVtQMUWfPY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 81.43393918939756,
      "y": 10015.92221238878,
      "width": 763,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d9480f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2037937779,
      "version": 120,
      "versionNonce": 1986605725,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3.循环调用 update：ikcp_update(kcp, millisec); //在一个线程、定时器 5ms/10m做调度",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3.循环调用 update：ikcp_update(kcp, millisec); //在一个线程、定时器 5ms/10m做调度"
    },
    {
      "id": "B9iZb_-0xs4QY7W55583T",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 81.43393918939756,
      "y": 10062.92221238878,
      "width": 968,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d9480f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1363582525,
      "version": 120,
      "versionNonce": 1710133683,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4.输入一个应用层数据包（如UDP收到的数据包）：ikcp_input(kcp,received_udp_packet,received_udp_size);",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4.输入一个应用层数据包（如UDP收到的数据包）：ikcp_input(kcp,received_udp_packet,received_udp_size);"
    },
    {
      "id": "v9tJ8mpBqx2OjE7v53PUJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 81.43393918939756,
      "y": 10109.92221238878,
      "width": 472,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d9480f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1118253075,
      "version": 119,
      "versionNonce": 591582973,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "    我们要使用recvfrom接收，然后扔到kcp里面做解析",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "    我们要使用recvfrom接收，然后扔到kcp里面做解析"
    },
    {
      "id": "3VEku5sT3IXCT3nFRyBOx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 81.43393918939756,
      "y": 10156.92221238878,
      "width": 513,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d9480f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 45207197,
      "version": 120,
      "versionNonce": 1211622227,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5.发送数据：ikcp_send(kcp1, buffer, 8);           用户层接口",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5.发送数据：ikcp_send(kcp1, buffer, 8);           用户层接口"
    },
    {
      "id": "gAyhWFzkQO4KhdCtpD-ys",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 81.43393918939756,
      "y": 10203.92221238878,
      "width": 544,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d9480f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 353220019,
      "version": 120,
      "versionNonce": 1646849885,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6.接收数据：hr = ikcp_recv(kcp2, buffer, 10); 用户层读取数据",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "6.接收数据：hr = ikcp_recv(kcp2, buffer, 10); 用户层读取数据"
