      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[0,3]conv:连接号。UDP是无连接的，conv用于表示来自于哪个客户端。对连接的一种替代",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 21,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[0,3]conv:连接号。UDP是无连接的，conv用于表示来自于哪个客户端。对连接的一种替代"
    },
    {
      "id": "hWqa9OOHmUbnjbFs12Abu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 380.83396360346006,
      "y": 12335.922227647568,
      "width": 548,
      "height": 79,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2101990867,
      "version": 187,
      "versionNonce": 2009848029,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700315628025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[4]cmd:命令字。如，IKCP_CMD_ACK确认命令，\n                            IKCP_CMD_WASK接收窗口大小询问命令，\n                       IKCP_CMD_WINS接收窗口大小告知命令，",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 74,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[4]cmd:命令字。如，IKCP_CMD_ACK确认命令，\n                            IKCP_CMD_WASK接收窗口大小询问命令，\n                       IKCP_CMD_WINS接收窗口大小告知命令，"
    },
